<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="no-js">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <title>{{ site_title }} — 주말에 마스터하는 Claude Code</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="claude를 입력하는 단계에서 에이전트, 훅, 스킬, MCP 서버를 자유롭게 조율하는 단계까지 — 시각적 튜토리얼, 복사해서 바로 쓰는 템플릿, 안내형 학습 경로를 갖춘 Claude Code 가이드입니다."
  />
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
  <meta name="theme-color" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" content="#fbfaf7" />
  <meta name="theme-color" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" content="#000000" />
  <link rel="icon" href="assets/resources/logos/claude-howto-logo.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/vendor/fonts/fonts.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/landing.css" />
  <script>
    // Apply the saved theme before paint to avoid flash of unstyled content.
    (function () {
      try {
        var saved = localStorage.getItem('claude-howto-theme');
        var prefersDark = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;
        var theme = saved || (prefersDark ? 'dark' : 'light');
        if (theme === 'dark') {
          document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
        }
      } catch (e) {}
    })();
  </script>
  <script>
    document.documentElement.classList.remove('no-js');
    document.documentElement.classList.add('js');
  </script>
  <script src="assets/landing.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#roadmap">로드맵으로 건너뛰기</a>

  {# ============ Sticky nav ============ #}
  <header class="nav" id="top">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a class="nav-brand" href="index.html" aria-label="Claude How-To 홈">
        <img
          src="assets/resources/logos/claude-howto-logo.svg"
          alt="claude-howto"
          class="nav-logo logo-light"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'"
        />
        <img
          src="assets/resources/logos/claude-howto-logo-dark.svg"
          alt="claude-howto"
          class="nav-logo logo-dark"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'"
        />
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links" id="nav-menu" aria-label="주 메뉴">
        <a href="#why">특징</a>
        <a href="#vs-docs">공식&nbsp;문서와&nbsp;비교</a>
        <a href="#roadmap">로드맵</a>
        <a href="{{ guide_url }}">가이드</a>
        <a href="{{ repo_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm nav-cta" href="#roadmap">학습 시작</a>
        <button
          class="theme-toggle"
          id="theme-toggle"
          type="button"
          aria-label="어두운 테마로 전환"
        >
          <svg class="ti-sun" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="4" />
            <path d="M10 1.8v2.2M10 16v2.2M1.8 10H4M16 10h2.2M4.2 4.2l1.6 1.6M14.2 14.2l1.6 1.6M15.8 4.2l-1.6 1.6M5.8 14.2l-1.6 1.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
          </svg>
          <svg class="ti-moon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M17.293 13.293A8 8 0 016.707 2.707a8.001 8.001 0 1010.586 10.586z" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button
          class="nav-toggle"
          id="nav-toggle"
          type="button"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="nav-menu"
          aria-label="메뉴 열기/닫기"
        >
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true">
            <path class="menu-open" d="M3 5.5h14M3 10h14M3 14.5h14" stroke-linecap="round" />
            <path class="menu-close" d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15" stroke-linecap="round" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    {# ============ Hero ============ #}
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow-row reveal" style="--d: 0s">
            <p class="eyebrow">~/claude-howto · 주말 커리큘럼</p>
            {% if version %}<span class="version-pill">v{{ version }} 기준</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title reveal" style="--d: 0.08s">
            주말에 마스터하는<br /><em>Claude&nbsp;Code</em>
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-sub reveal" style="--d: 0.16s">
            <code>claude</code>를 입력하는 단계에서 에이전트, 훅, 스킬, MCP 서버를
            자유롭게 조율하는 단계까지 — 시각적 튜토리얼, 복사해서 바로 쓰는
            템플릿, 안내형 학습 경로가 함께합니다.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-cta reveal" style="--d: 0.24s">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#roadmap">로드맵 시작하기</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ guide_url }}">가이드 읽기</a>
          </div>
          <dl class="hero-stats reveal" style="--d: 0.32s">
            <div class="stat">
              <dt>모듈</dt>
              <dd>{{ module_count }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <dt>소요 시간</dt>
              <dd>11–13&nbsp;시간</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <dt>레슨</dt>
              <dd>{{ lesson_count }}</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div
          class="hero-term reveal"
          style="--d: 0.2s"
          role="img"
          aria-label="짧은 Claude Code 세션의 터미널 화면: claude 실행, /init과 /self-assessment 실행, 훅 실행, 서브에이전트의 작업 위임"
        >
          <div class="term">
            <div class="term-bar">
              <span class="term-dot"></span>
              <span class="term-dot"></span>
              <span class="term-dot"></span>
              <span class="term-title">~/project — claude</span>
            </div>
            <div class="term-body" id="terminal">
              <div class="t-line" data-t="cmd"><span class="t-pp">$</span><span class="t-tt">claude</span></div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="out" data-c="dim">Claude Code · working in ~/project</div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="cmd"><span class="t-pp t-pp-in">&gt;</span><span class="t-tt">/init</span></div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="out" data-c="ok">✓ wrote CLAUDE.md — 6 rules, 3 imports</div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="cmd"><span class="t-pp t-pp-in">&gt;</span><span class="t-tt">/self-assessment</span></div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="out" data-c="info">→ 레벨: 중급 · 03-skills부터 시작</div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="cmd"><span class="t-pp t-pp-in">&gt;</span><span class="t-tt">API에 속도 제한 추가해 줘</span></div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="out" data-c="warn">⚡ hook PreToolUse → ruff check . — passed</div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="out" data-c="ok">◆ Explore agent → mapped 14 routes — done</div>
              <div class="t-line" data-t="cmd"><span class="t-pp">$</span><span class="t-tt"></span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ============ Why / value ============ #}
    <section class="section" id="why">
      <p class="kicker reveal">왜 이 가이드인가</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">공식 문서는 <em>무엇</em>을 알려 주고,<br />이 가이드는 <em>어떻게</em>를 보여 줍니다.</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
              <rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
              <path d="M10 6.5h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3V14M14 17.5h-4a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>시각 자료가 기본</h3>
          <p>
            Mermaid 다이어그램으로 각 기능이 내부에서 어떻게 동작하는지 보여 주어
            <em>어떻게</em>뿐 아니라 <em>왜</em>까지 이해할 수 있습니다.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal" style="--d: 0.08s">
          <div class="card-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="2" />
              <path d="M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>복사해서 바로 쓰는 템플릿</h3>
          <p>
            실무에 바로 쓸 수 있는 슬래시 명령어, CLAUDE.md 파일, 훅 스크립트, MCP
            설정, 플러그인 번들 — 오늘 바로 프로젝트에 넣어 쓰세요.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal" style="--d: 0.16s">
          <div class="card-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2.5" />
              <circle cx="18" cy="5" r="2.5" />
              <path d="M8 17.5 10 15a10 10 0 0 1 6-7.5" />
              <path d="M8.5 19H15" stroke-dasharray="2 2.6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>안내형 학습 경로</h3>
          <p>
            배우는 순서대로 놓인 10개 모듈 — 11–13시간 만에 입문자에서 파워
            유저로 성장합니다. 다음에 무엇을 배울지 더는 고민하지 않아도 됩니다.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal" style="--d: 0.24s">
          <div class="card-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M9 11.5 11 14l4.5-5" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>내장 자가 진단</h3>
          <p>
            Claude Code에서 <code>/self-assessment</code>나 <code>/lesson-quiz</code>를
            실행해 부족한 부분을 찾고 맞춤 경로를 받으세요.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ============ Docs vs guide ============ #}
    <section class="section" id="vs-docs">
      <p class="kicker reveal">공식 문서와 이 가이드</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">같은 도구, 다른 역할</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        이 가이드는
        <a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/ko/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">공식 문서</a>를
        보완합니다 — 공식 문서는 레퍼런스이고, 이 가이드는 커리큘럼입니다.
      </p>
      <div class="versus reveal">
        <div class="versus-head" role="presentation">
          <span></span>
          <span class="v-docs">공식 문서</span>
          <span class="v-guide">이 가이드</span>
        </div>
        <div class="versus-row">
          <span class="v-label">형식</span>
          <span class="v-docs">레퍼런스 문서</span>
          <span class="v-guide">Mermaid 다이어그램을 곁들인 시각적 튜토리얼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="versus-row">
          <span class="v-label">깊이</span>
          <span class="v-docs">기능 설명</span>
          <span class="v-guide">내부 동작 원리까지</span>
        </div>
        <div class="versus-row">
          <span class="v-label">예제</span>
          <span class="v-docs">기본 코드 조각</span>
          <span class="v-guide">바로 쓸 수 있는 실무용 템플릿</span>
        </div>
        <div class="versus-row">
          <span class="v-label">구성</span>
          <span class="v-docs">기능별 구성</span>
          <span class="v-guide">단계별 학습 경로(입문부터 고급까지)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="versus-row">
          <span class="v-label">온보딩</span>
          <span class="v-docs">스스로 알아서</span>
          <span class="v-guide">예상 소요 시간이 표시된 안내형 로드맵</span>
        </div>
        <div class="versus-row">
          <span class="v-label">자가 진단</span>
          <span class="v-docs">없음</span>
          <span class="v-guide">맞춤 경로를 만들어 주는 대화형 퀴즈</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ============ Roadmap ============ #}
    <section class="section roadmap" id="roadmap">
      <p class="kicker reveal">로드맵</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">한 노선, 열 개의 역</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        레벨 3개, 모듈 {{ module_count }}개, 레슨 {{ lesson_count }}개.
        진도는 브라우저에 저장되니, 공부하면서 레슨을 하나씩 체크하세요.
      </p>

      <div class="progress-panel reveal" id="progress-panel">
        <div class="ring-wrap" role="img" aria-label="전체 진도">
          <svg class="ring" viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle class="ring-bg" cx="60" cy="60" r="52" />
            <circle class="ring-fg" id="ring-fg" cx="60" cy="60" r="52" />
          </svg>
          <div class="ring-label">
            <span class="ring-pct" id="ring-pct">0%</span>
            <span class="ring-cap">완료</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-mid">
          <p class="counts">
            <span>완료 <b id="c-done">0</b></span>
            <span class="counts-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
            <span>진행 중 <b id="c-prog">0</b></span>
            <span class="counts-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
            <span>시작 전 <b id="c-todo">{{ lesson_count }}</b></span>
          </p>
          <div class="progress-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="continue-btn" href="#roadmap">이어서 하기</a>
            <span class="all-done" id="all-done" hidden>모두 끝났습니다 — 로드맵을 완주했습니다.</span>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="reset-btn" type="button">진도 초기화</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subway" id="subway">
        <div class="track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="track-fill" id="track-fill"></div></div>
        {% for level in levels %}
        <section class="level" aria-labelledby="level-{{ level.id }}">
          <header class="level-head reveal">
            <p class="level-name">{{ level.name }}</p>
            <h3 class="level-title" id="level-{{ level.id }}">{{ level.title }}</h3>
            <p class="level-sum">{{ level.summary }}</p>
          </header>
          <ol class="stations">
            {% for module in level.modules %}
            <li class="station reveal" data-module="{{ module.id }}" data-status="not-started">
              <span class="node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <article class="station-card">
                <header class="station-head">
                  <span class="station-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ module.number }}</span>
                  <div class="station-meta">
                    <h4 class="station-title">
                      <a href="{{ module.lessons[0].href if module.lessons else module.url }}">{{ module.title }}</a>
                    </h4>
                    <p class="station-tag">{{ module.tagline }}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="station-side">
                    <span class="station-time">{{ module.time }}</span>
                    <span class="pill" data-pill>시작 전</span>
                  </div>
                </header>
                <div class="station-bar">
                  <span class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i data-bar></i></span>
                  <span class="bar-count" data-count>0/{{ module.lesson_count }}</span>
                </div>
                <button
                  class="station-toggle"
                  type="button"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="lessons-{{ module.id }}"
                >
                  <span>레슨 {{ module.lesson_count }}개</span>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" />
                  </svg>
                </button>
                <ul class="lessons" id="lessons-{{ module.id }}">
                  {% for lesson in module.lessons %}
                  <li class="lesson" data-lesson="{{ lesson.full_id }}" data-status="not-started">
                    <button
                      class="check"
                      type="button"
                      role="checkbox"
                      aria-checked="false"
                      aria-label="'{{ lesson.title }}' 완료로 표시"
                    >
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path class="check-dash" d="M4 8h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        <path class="check-mark" d="M3.2 8.6 6.4 11.6 13 4.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                    </button>
                    <a class="lesson-link" href="{{ lesson.href }}">{{ lesson.title }}</a>
                    <span class="lesson-status" data-lstatus>시작 전</span>
                  </li>
                  {% endfor %}
                </ul>
              </article>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ol>
        </section>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ============ Get started ============ #}
    <section class="section" id="get-started">
      <p class="kicker reveal">시작하기</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">15분 만에 첫 워크플로우까지</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step reveal">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <h3>저장소 복제</h3>
          <p>모든 내용이 마크다운입니다 — 템플릿까지 들어 있어 따로 설치할 것이 없습니다.</p>
          <div class="code">
            <code>git clone {{ repo_url }}.git claude-howto</code>
            <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="git clone {{ repo_url }}.git claude-howto" aria-label="복제 명령 복사">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="5.5" y="5.5" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" />
                <path d="M10.5 5.5V4a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5H4A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.5 4v5A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 4 10.5h1.5" />
              </svg>
              <span class="copy-label">복사</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step reveal" style="--d: 0.08s">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <h3>자가 진단 받기</h3>
          <p>Claude Code에서 내 수준을 찾고, 이미 아는 내용은 건너뛰세요.</p>
          <div class="code">
            <code>/self-assessment</code>
            <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="/self-assessment" aria-label="자가 진단 명령 복사">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="5.5" y="5.5" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" />
                <path d="M10.5 5.5V4a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5H4A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.5 4v5A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 4 10.5h1.5" />
              </svg>
              <span class="copy-label">복사</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step reveal" style="--d: 0.16s">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <h3>로드맵 따라가기</h3>
          <p>내 레벨의 모듈부터 차례로 공부하세요 — 진도는 위에서 기록됩니다.</p>
          <a class="step-link" href="#roadmap">내 레벨에서 시작하기 →</a>
        </li>
      </ol>
